              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ makithathi onthe ma ana ma Isilaeli nĩ makwa, mũndũ o na nyamũ: mũthenya ũla nooaie makithathi onthe nthĩ ya Misili nĩnamavathie methĩwe makwa. ",
          "type": "text",
