              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakwa nĩnĩmosete Alivai vandũ va makithathi onthe ma ana ma Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na nĩnĩmũnengete Aluni na ana make asu Alivai kuma nthĩnĩ wa ana ma Isilaeli, matethye wĩa wa ana ma Isilaeli ĩeemanĩ ya kũmbanĩa, mamathembeae ana ma Isilaeli nthembo ya wĩw’anĩthyo; nĩ kana vatikethĩwe ũthĩn’yo kwa ana ma Isilaeli, yĩla ana ma Isilaeli meũthengeea vala vandũ vatheu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.19"
            ]
          }
