              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũu nĩw’o Mose na Aluni na ũmbano w’onthe wa ana ma Isilaeli mamekie Alivai: kwĩanana na onthe ala Yeova wamwĩaĩe Mose ũndũ wa Alivai, ũu nĩw’o ana ma Isilaeli mamekie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Alivai meethesya naĩ, na mathambya ngũa syoo: na Aluni amũnenga Yeova mo methĩwe nthembo ya kũvyũlw’a; na Aluni athemba nthembo ya wĩw’anĩthyo kwondũ woo amathesya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina wa ũu Alivai nĩmalikile kũthũkũmaa ĩeemanĩ ya kũmbanĩa makĩsiw’a nĩ Aluni na ana make: o tondũ Yeova wamwĩaĩe Mose ũndũ wa Alivai, nĩw’o mamekie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
